1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,080
M: Wasn't there supposed to be a yoga class in the conference room at noon today?

2
00:00:08,080 --> 00:00:13,040
I stopped in right at noon and no one was there. I was really looking forward to it.

3
00:00:13,040 --> 00:00:14,220
W: Didn't you get the email

4
00:00:14,780 --> 00:00:18,030
The instructor had a personal conflict and had to cancel.

5
00:00:18,030 --> 00:00:19,150
M: When did she send it?

6
00:00:19,150 --> 00:00:22,110
W: I don't know. Maybe quarter after 11?

7
00:00:22,110 --> 00:00:25,400
M: That makes sense. I've been away from my desk

8
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:27,260
since mid morning and haven't checked my email.

9
00:00:27,260 --> 00:00:32,020
W: Then you probably don't know that she is rescheduled for tomorrow.
